tep is substituted by another one. For a critical assessment of the chosen energy parameters, it is not sufficient to compare kMC simulations only to experimental turnover frequency (TOF) as a function of the reactant feed ratio. More appropriate benchmarks for kMC simulations are the actual distribution of reactants on the catalyst's surface during steady\u2010state reaction, as determined by <jats:italic>in situ<\/jats:italic> infrared spectroscopy and <jats:italic>in situ<\/jats:italic> scanning tunneling microscopy, and the temperature dependence of TOF in the from of Arrhenius plots. \u00a9 2012 Wiley Periodicals, Inc.<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.1002\/jcc.22902","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2012,1,18]],"date-time":"2012-01-18T05:19:41Z","timestamp":1326863981000},"page":"757-766","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":45,"title":["\u201cFirst\u2010Principles\u201d kinetic monte carlo simulations revisited: CO oxidation over RuO<sub>2<\/sub>(110)"],"prefix":"10.1002","volume":"33","author":[{"given":"Franziska","family":"Hess","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Attila","family":"Farkas","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Ari P.","family":"Seitsonen","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Herbert","family":"Over","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]}],"member":"311","published-online":{"date-parts":[[2012,1,18]]},"reference":[{"key":"e_1_2_5_1_2","volume-title":"Chemical Kinetics","author":"Laidler K. J.","year":"1987"},{"key":"e_1_2_5_2_2","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1088\/0953-8984\/20\/18\/184017"},{"key":"e_1_2_5_3_2","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1016\/0021-9991(76)90041-3"},{"key":"e_1_2_5_4_2","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1016\/0021-9991(75)90060-1"},{"key"